Subject: [PATCH] plugins/slidingpopups: let popups follow a panel sliding in

When a popup opened from a hidden auto-hide panel, it slid in from the
panel's final position while the panel was still sliding in, leaving a
gap between them. Such popups now move along with the panel's slide.

BUG: 470102
---
 src/plugins/slidingpopups/slidingpopups.cpp | 125 +++++++++++++++-----
 src/plugins/slidingpopups/slidingpopups.h   |   2 +
 2 files changed, 99 insertions(+), 28 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/plugins/slidingpopups/slidingpopups.cpp b/src/plugins/slidingpopups/slidingpopups.cpp
